<title>HONG KONG: Asia Commercial Bank launches HK$500 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Asia Commercial Bank launches HK$500 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Schroders Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER ASIA COMMERCIAL BANK		 GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	HK$500 MLN  COUPON    3MH+60     MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    16.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YRS 3, 4    CALLS     YRS 3, 4   REPLIES     30.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY  PAY DATE    NOVEMBER</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CROSS DEF NO	   FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HONG KONG   HOME CTRY HONG KONG  TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  SNR MGRS  HK$40 MLN 69 BP ALL-IN 83</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  HK$25 MLN 63 BP ALL-IN 81</p>
<p>ARRANGER  SCHRODERS ASIA (BOOKS), TOKAI ASIA (BOOKS), SAKURA</p>
<p>	     FINANCE ASIA, COMMERZ BANK</p>
<p> NOTES     ASIA COMMERCIAL BANK SHAREDHOLDERS TAT LEE BANK AND</p>
<p>	     BANGKOK BANK ARE EXPECTED TO JOIN THE GROUP.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
